9" value="아는 명령이고 대상 로봇이 맞는가?" style="rhombus;rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FFF6E0;strokeColor=#C88A00;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3114" y="4500" width="400" height="50" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c470" value="거부 이유를 답한다&#10;이번 명령은 여기서 끝" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FDECEC;strokeColor=#C0272D;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3544" y="4503" width="250" height="45" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c471" value="운영자가 개입한 사실을 기록 파일에 남긴다" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=11;fillColor=#EEF4FD;strokeColor=#5B87C4;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3114" y="4574" width="400" height="31" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c472" value="작업 종료를 그 로봇에 알린다&#10;짝 지정이면 그 로봇의 인지 노드에 판정을 넘긴다" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=11;fillColor=#E8F0FE;strokeColor=#1F5FBF;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3114" y="4629" width="400" height="45" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c473" value="인지 노드의 수락 여부를 그대로 운영자에게 답한다" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=11;fillColor=#EEF4FD;strokeColor=#5B87C4;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3114" y="4698" width="400" height="31" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e474" value="예" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#4A4A4A;strokeWidth=1.4;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=10;fontColor=#4A4A4A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=6;jettySize=auto;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c469" target="c471"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e475" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#4A4A4A;strokeWidth=1.4;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=10;fontColor=#4A4A4A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=6;jettySize=auto;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c471" target="c472"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e476" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#4A4A4A;strokeWidth=1.4;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=10;fontColor=#4A4A4A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=6;jettySize=auto;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c472" target="c473"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e477" value="아니오" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#4A4A4A;strokeWidth=1.4;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=10;fontColor=#4A4A4A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=6;jettySize=auto;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c469" target="c470"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c480" value="운영자 · 웹 브라우저&#10;로봇 상태를 보고 자재 요청 · 작업 종료 · 짝 지정을 누른다&#10;HTTP 5000번 문 (ROS 가 아니다)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=11;fillColor=#EFEFEF;strokeColor=#777777;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2744" y="4889" width="400" height="60" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c481" value="실행 구조&#10;ROS 쪽과 웹 서버가 서로 다른 스레드에서 돈다&#10;웹 요청이 오면 관제에 ROS 서비스를 부르고 그 답을 화면에 돌려준다&#10;아레나 지도 그림도 같이 띄운다 (경로는 설정에서 읽는다)&#10;보여 주는 로봇 목록과 짝 상태 세 가지(짝지어짐 · 게이트 미달 · 대상 없음)는 설정으로 둔다" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=11;fillColor=#EFEFEF;strokeColor=#777777;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2744" y="4973" width="400" height="104" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c482" value="웹 대시보드 시작" style="ellipse;rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=11;fillColor=#E4ECF7;strokeColor=#3B6CA8;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2744" y="5101" width="400" height="34" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c483" value="로봇별 최신 상태를 화면에 표시한다&#10;상태 · 배터리 · 위치 · 미션 · 작업자 · 비상정지 · 짝" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=11;fillColor=#EEF4FD;strokeColor=#5B87C4;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2744" y="5159" width="400" height="45" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c484" value="운영자가 누른 것은?" style="rhombus;rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FFF6E0;strokeColor=#C88A00;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2744" y="5228" width="400" height="50" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c485" value="관제에 서비스로 물어본다&#10;자재 요청 · 작업 종료 · 짝 지정 중 하나" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=11;fillColor=#EEF4FD;strokeColor=#5B87C4;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2744" y="5302" width="400" height="45" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c486" value="관제가 어느 갈래로 처리하는지는 명령 종류가 정한다&#10;자재 요청은 미션을 새로 만들고, 종료·짝 지정은 운영자 개입으로 기록한다" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=11;fillColor=#EEF4FD;strokeColor=#5B87C4;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2744" y="5371" width="400" height="45" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c487" value="관제가 받아들였는가?" style="rhombus;rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FFF6E0;strokeColor=#C88A00;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2744" y="5440" width="400" height="50" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c488" value="거절 이유를 화면에 표시&#10;이번 요청은 여기서 끝" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FDECEC;strokeColor=#C0272D;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3174" y="5443" width="250" height="45" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c489" value="결과를 화면에 표시한다 (미션 번호 · 성공 여부)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=11;fillColor=#EEF4FD;strokeColor=#5B87C4;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2744" y="5514" width="400" height="31" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c490" value="짝 지정이 성공하면 개입 사실을 한 번 알린다&#10;채점에서 사람 손이 들어간 횟수로 센다" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=11;fillColor=#E8F0FE;strokeColor=#1F5FBF;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2744" y="5569" width="400" height="45" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e491" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#4A4A4A;strokeWidth=1.4;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=10;fontColor=#4A4A4A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=6;jettySize=auto;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c480" target="c481"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e492" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#4A4A4A;strokeWidth=1.4;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=10;fontColor=#4A4A4A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=6;jettySize=auto;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c481" target="c482"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e493" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#4A4A4A;strokeWidth=1.4;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=10;fontColor=#4A4A4A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=6;jettySize=auto;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c482" target="c483"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e494" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#4A4A4A;strokeWidth=1.4;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=10;fontColor=#4A4A4A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=6;jettySize=auto;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c483" target="c484"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e495" value="세 가지 중 하나" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#4A4A4A;strokeWidth=1.4;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=10;fontColor=#4A4A4A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=6;jettySize=auto;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c484" target="c485"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e496" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#4A4A4A;strokeWidth=1.4;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=10;fontColor=#4A4A4A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=6;jettySize=auto;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c485" target="c486"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e497" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#4A4A4A;strokeWidth=1.4;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=10;fontColor=#4A4A4A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=6;jettySize=auto;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c486" target="c487"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e498" value="예" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#4A4A4A;strokeWidth=1.4;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=10;fontColor=#4A4A4A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=6;jettySize=auto;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c487" target="c489"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e499" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#4A4A4A;strokeWidth=1.4;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=10;fontColor=#4A4A4A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=6;jettySize=auto;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c489" target="c490"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e500" value="아니오" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#4A4A4A;strokeWidth=1.4;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=10;fontColor=#4A4A4A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=6;jettySize=auto;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c487" target="c488"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e501" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#4A4A4A;strokeWidth=1.4;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=10;fontColor=#4A4A4A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=6;jettySize=auto;dashed=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c488" target="c482"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="3445" y="5465" /><mxPoint x="3445" y="5089" /><mxPoint x="2725" y="5089" /><mxPoint x="2725" y="5118" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c504" value="구역 잠금 서버가 돈다&#10;구역은 둘뿐 — P1 병목(폭 0.79 m) · DOCK 도크" style="ellipse;rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=11;fillColor=#E4ECF7;strokeColor=#3B6CA8;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2374" y="5714" width="400" height="45" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c505" value="로봇이 구역 안에 있는지 좌표로 계산하지 않는다&#10;「들어가기 직전에 얻고 나온 직후에 돌려준다」는 순서만 지키면 된다" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=11;fillColor=#EEF4FD;strokeColor=#5B87C4;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2374" y="5783" width="400" height="45" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c506" value="바꿀 수 있는 값&#10;억지 회수까지 기다리는 시간 60초 — 정상 통과는 10~20초 (좁은 목 이동만 3~9초)&#10;감시 주기 1초  ·  로봇이 다시 물어보는 주기 2초 (로봇 쪽에서 정한다)&#10;구역 이름은 아레나 설정 파일의 목록과 반드시 같아야 한다&#10;되살리는 신호(하트비트) 규칙은 두지 않는다 — 계약에 없다" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=11;fillColor=#EFEFEF;strokeColor=#777777;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2374" y="5852" width="400" height="104" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c507" value="아는 구역 이름인가?&#10;요청 = 로봇 이름 · 구역 이름 · 얻기인지 돌려주기인지" style="rhombus;rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FFF6E0;strokeColor=#C88A00;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2374" y="5980" width="400" height="57" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c508" value="거절로 답한다 — 이번 요청은 여기서 끝" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FDECEC;strokeColor=#C0272D;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2804" y="5993" width="250" height="31" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c509" value="얻으러 온 요청인가?" style="rhombus;rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FFF6E0;strokeColor=#C88A00;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2374" y="6061" width="400" height="50" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c510" value="구역이 비었거나 이미 내가 가지고 있는가?" style="rhombus;rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FFF6E0;strokeColor=#C88A00;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2374" y="6135" width="400" height="50" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c511" value="나보다 먼저 기다린 로봇이 있는가?" style="rhombus;rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FFF6E0;strokeColor=#C88A00;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2374" y="6209" width="400" height="50" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c512" value="대기 명단에서 나온다" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=11;fillColor=#EEF4FD;strokeColor=#5B87C4;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2374" y="6283" width="400" height="31" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c513" value="이번에 처음 얻는 것인가?" style="rhombus;rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FFF6E0;strokeColor=#C88A00;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2374" y="6338" width="400" height="50" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c514" value="가진 시각을 다시 적지 않는다&#10;다시 물을 때마다 고치면 60초 회수를 무한정 미룰 수 있다" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FDECEC;strokeColor=#C0272D;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2804" y="6333" width="250" height="60" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c515" value="가지기 시작한 시각을 적는다" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=11;fillColor=#EEF4FD;strokeColor=#5B87C4;ve